+## Failed session initialization
+
+- When `beforeSession` throws an `Error`, the turn rejects with that same error after awaiting `onError(session, error)` and then `afterSession(session)`; input and model-response hooks do not run. Cleanup runs even when initialization failed: `afterSession` receives the same session and must tolerate resources that were never allocated or only partially initialized; it cannot assume input processing or a model response occurred ([validated by: reports and cleans up a failed beforeSession before rejecting with the original error](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.acceptance.test.ts#L7)).
+
